# AGP is an application workspace (probe runner + games): its Cargo.lock is
# committed reproducibility evidence. The repository-root .gitignore ignores
# Cargo.lock (library convention); re-include it here.
# target/ stays ignored via the root rule.
!Cargo.lock
# The frozen breakout golden trace IS committed oracle evidence (the root
# *.json ignore targets config dumps; re-include it here).
!testdata/breakout/golden_trace.json
!testdata/squash/golden_squash_trace.json
